From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: timvdhoorn <timvdhoorn@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 20:35:43 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(mobile): register push tokens directly with paired
 servers

Custom-identity iOS builds register their APNs device token, Live Activity token and notification preferences with every paired T3 server instead of T3's relay, whose APNs key cannot push to another bundle id. The official build keeps the relay path.
